            ["Running \u2014 it can fight ClawTweaks for the controller and LED. You'll be guided to deactivate it after the app is installed."] = "En cours \u2014 il peut disputer la manette et la LED \u00E0 ClawTweaks. Vous serez guid\u00E9 pour le d\u00E9sactiver apr\u00E8s l'installation.",
            ["Running. Press \u24B6 to close it now. For a permanent fix, uninstall it from Windows Settings \u203A Apps and reinstall the latest version if you still need it."] = "En cours. \u24B6 pour le fermer maintenant. D\u00E9finitivement : d\u00E9sinstallez-le dans Param\u00E8tres Windows \u203A Applications et r\u00E9installez la derni\u00E8re version si besoin.",
            ["Save"] = "Sauver",
