            ["Opens Steam in the tray when you open the library. The first Steam game after a boot starts faster."] = "Ouvre Steam dans la zone de notification \u00E0 l'ouverture de la biblioth\u00E8que. Le premier jeu Steam apr\u00E8s le d\u00E9marrage se lance plus vite.",
            ["In fullscreen mode, Steam's window can open behind Center."] = "En plein \u00E9cran, la fen\u00EAtre de Steam peut s'ouvrir derri\u00E8re Center.",
            ["Steam removes the game files. In fullscreen, Steam's dialog can open behind Center."] = "Steam supprime les fichiers du jeu. En plein \u00E9cran, sa fen\u00EAtre peut s'ouvrir derri\u00E8re Center.",
