            ["All ClawTweaks settings, the library and the Center settings were reset. Center restarts now."] = "Tous les r\u00E9glages ClawTweaks, la biblioth\u00E8que et les r\u00E9glages de Center ont \u00E9t\u00E9 r\u00E9initialis\u00E9s. Center red\u00E9marre.",
