            ["That is what makes the extra controller features possible."] = "Eso es lo que hace posibles las funciones adicionales del mando.",
            ["That key was rejected."] = "Esa clave fue rechazada.",
            ["The charge limit, the fan curve and the controller mode can only be reset by ClawTweaks. Install it again to restore them, then come back here. You can still uninstall Center."] = "Solo ClawTweaks puede restablecer el l\u00EDmite de carga, la curva del ventilador y el modo del mando. Vuelve a instalarlo y regresa aqu\u00ED. Aun as\u00ED puedes desinstalar Center.",
            ["The controller did not confirm \u2014 check it before you unplug."] = "El mando no confirm\u00F3 \u2014 compru\u00E9balo antes de desconectar.",
            ["The device can be restored"] = "El dispositivo puede restaurarse",
            ["The helper did not confirm in time."] = "El helper no confirm\u00F3 a tiempo.",
            ["The helper is not answering"] = "El helper no responde",
            ["The library comes back when the game ends."] = "La biblioteca vuelve al terminar el juego.",
            ["The native controller must be clean before the virtual controller mode can work. In virtual mode the physical pad is hidden and one virtual VIIPER controller is active; in hardware mode the physical pad is used directly."] = "El mando nativo debe estar limpio antes de que funcione el modo de mando virtual. En modo virtual el mando f\u00EDsico se oculta y hay un mando virtual VIIPER activo; en modo hardware se usa el mando f\u00EDsico directamente.",
            ["The newest changes, least tested"] = "Los cambios m\u00E1s nuevos, los menos probados",
            ["The old helper exited on its own."] = "El asistente anterior se cerr\u00F3 solo.",
            ["The old version's uninstaller is running \u2014 confirm its prompt. This notice disappears once it's gone (press \u24CE to refresh)."] = "El desinstalador de la versi\u00F3n antigua est\u00E1 en marcha \u2014 confirma su aviso. Este mensaje desaparece cuando termine (\u24CE para actualizar).",
            ["The package could not be removed. Close the Game Bar and try again, or remove ClawTweaks from Settings \u2192 Apps."] = "No se pudo quitar el paquete. Cierra la Game Bar e int\u00E9ntalo otra vez, o quita ClawTweaks desde Configuraci\u00F3n \u2192 Aplicaciones.",
            ["The package family conflicted with this update. Clearing it and retrying once\u2026"] = "La familia de paquetes bloque\u00F3 esta actualizaci\u00F3n. Se limpia y se reintenta una vez\u2026",
            ["The reset did not finish."] = "El restablecimiento no termin\u00F3.",
            ["The signing certificate uses Windows' own prompt, once per device."] = "El certificado usa la ventana de Windows, una vez por dispositivo.",
            ["The widget shows what the helper does; it changes nothing by itself."] = "El widget muestra lo que hace el helper; no cambia nada por s\u00ED solo.",
            ["The wiki page could not be read. Open it in a browser."] = "No se pudo leer la p\u00E1gina wiki. \u00C1brela en el navegador.",
            ["This Setup build is outdated"] = "Este build de Setup es antiguo",
            ["This installs an OLDER version than the one installed."] = "Esto instala una versi\u00F3n M\u00C1S ANTIGUA que la instalada.",
            ["This is a scaffold build without a bundled package, so there's nothing to install here. In a real setup bundle the .msix and .cer sit next to this exe."] = "Este es un build de andamiaje sin paquete, as\u00ED que no hay nada que instalar. En un bundle real el .msix y el .cer est\u00E1n junto a este exe.",
            ["This puts the device back and clears your ClawTweaks settings:"] = "Esto restaura el dispositivo y borra tus ajustes de ClawTweaks:",
            ["This removes ClawTweaks Center and closes it."] = "Esto quita ClawTweaks Center y lo cierra.",
            ["This removes the ClawTweaks app from Windows."] = "Esto quita la app ClawTweaks de Windows.",
            ["This resets ALL ClawTweaks settings to a clean state:"] = "Esto restablece TODOS los ajustes de ClawTweaks:",
            ["This takes a moment."] = "Esto tarda un momento.",
            ["This version can't be installed"] = "Esta versi\u00F3n no se puede instalar",
            ["This version is already installed. Open it from the Start Menu or the ClawTweaks Game Bar widget instead of running this Setup file again."] = "Esta versi\u00F3n ya est\u00E1 instalada. \u00C1brela desde el men\u00FA Inicio o el widget de ClawTweaks en la Game Bar en vez de ejecutar este archivo otra vez.",
            ["Timed out"] = "Tiempo agotado",
            ["Transition to new Center App - Uninstall the old version"] = "Cambio al nuevo Center \u2014 desinstala la versi\u00F3n antigua",
            ["Trusts the signing certificate, installs the app package, opens the Game Bar and waits for the helper. Safe to run again on an update."] = "Conf\u00EDa en el certificado, instala el paquete, abre la Game Bar y espera al helper. Se puede repetir sin riesgo en una actualizaci\u00F3n.",
