            ["Waiting for UAC\u2026"] = "Esperando a UAC\u2026",
            ["Waiting for the ClawTweaks helper to start. If the Game Bar opened but nothing happens, select the ClawTweaks Widget in its widget menu and add it \u2014 a widget that isn't in the Game Bar yet doesn't start the helper on its own."] = "Esperando a que se inicie el asistente de ClawTweaks. Si la Game Bar se abri\u00F3 y no ocurre nada, selecciona el widget de ClawTweaks en su men\u00FA de widgets y a\u00F1\u00E1delo \u2014 un widget que a\u00FAn no est\u00E1 en la Game Bar no inicia el asistente por s\u00ED solo.",
