            ["HW Mouse ON \u2014 controller paused. Click the HW Mouse tile or press the keyboard hotkey to return."] = "Mysz HW w\u0142\u0105czona \u2014 kontroler wstrzymany. Kliknij kafelek Mysz HW lub u\u017Cyj skr\u00F3tu, aby wr\u00F3ci\u0107.",
